Hi Steve,
Thanks for the question. I think the issue is coming from this line:

new.Y ~ dnorm(beta0 + beta1*x1 + beta2*x2, sd = sigma)

Here you are declaring a scalar node `new.Y` and making its mean depend on the vectors x1 and x2. I'm wondering if you want
for(i in 1:n) {
  new.Y[i] ~ dnorm(beta0 + beta1*x1[i] + beta2*x2[i], sd = sigma)
}
Or, if you want a single new.Y, you will need to provide an expression for the mean that gives a scalar.
HTH!
Perry

