Hi Pulong,

Your code seems ok to me, but I received different errors when compiling the model. One thing that works on my machine is to register the distribution explicitly by registerDistributions("dmy_prior")after sourcing your user-defined code. In theory it should be registered automatically when a user-defined distribution is used for the first time. I do not see a reason for this though - other people may explain it better, but you can go ahead if you need a solution right now.

Best wishes,
Wei

