Here is the code for the model with the highlighted red line for using "dmy_prior."  The full code is my first email if needed.

code = nimbleCode({
  # hierarchical model
  for(j in 1:J){
    y[j] ~ dbinom(theta[j], n[j])
    theta[j] ~ dbeta(alpha, beta)
  }
  # prior
  alpha <- ab[1]
  beta <- ab[2]
  ab[1:2] ~ dmy_prior()
})

Thanks,
Pulong

